#: includes/admin-kit/class-connection.php:96
msgid "Zinn Digital® answered, but not with a connection this plugin understands. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Zinn Digital® je odgovorio, ali ne sa vezom koju ovaj dodatak razume. Ništa nije sačuvano."

#: includes/admin-kit/class-connection.php:161
msgid "This site has forgotten its connection. Zinn Digital® could not be told just now, so support staff will see it as unused until it is removed on their side."
